{
  "answer": "Yes, you can bring your cat in the cabin on a Light fare, provided it meets the requirements: the combined weight of the pet and carrier must not exceed 8 kg, the carrier must not exceed 45 x 30 x 25 cm and must stay under the seat for the whole flight, and the pet must be at least 12 weeks old. A maximum of 3 pets are accepted in the cabin per flight, with one carrier per passenger. The pet fee applies (EUR 55 per flight). You can still bring your personal item. The pet carrier counts as your cabin bag, but since you are on a Light fare, you are allowed only one personal item. The pet carrier is allowed in addition to your personal item.",
  "policy_covers_question": true
}
